WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Liguitang is different from normal Litangkou

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,800
Xiaotie, are you ready?

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,670
Close your eyes and let go, the fairy family is fighting

4
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:11,870
The old immortal from the Zhou family is here. Why don’t you come down and go?

5
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:14,910
They're coming. They're really coming.

6
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:16,910
To protect you from being born safely

7
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:20,110
Thousands of my clan members died and were injured.

8
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:23,310
Good for you. Si Tang Dan destroys the incense burner.

9
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:25,310
Grandma Mengxian, you’re my bastard

10
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:27,510
If you want to kill or cut into pieces, the immortal family will be able to appease their anger.

11
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:29,110
I asked this kid to come up with something every month

12
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:30,910
Pay tribute to you as a sign of respect

13
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:33,310
Okay, then I'll do as you say

14
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:34,910
Pay tribute on the first and fifteenth day of the lunar month

15
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:36,510
I only eat eggs and fruits

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:37,910
Don't eat meat or drink alcohol

17
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,110
I am Huang Dachui

18
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:42,390
Just bring me a roast chicken as tribute

19
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:43,590
Unfilial descendants

20
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,190
If I were to bring a spear today

21
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:46,990
I'll definitely give you a pair to wear

22
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:49,190
Do you know how much effort I put into asking Mang Jian?

23
00:00:49,190 --> 00:00:52,480
Dare I ask what the relationship between King Bei and Zhou Tie is?

24
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:53,680
I am her second aunt

25
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:55,480
Why should construction have such illusions?

26
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:57,280
You shouldn't change your name in one day

27
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,280
What's more, the time has not come yet

28
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:01,080
You won’t know what you’re not supposed to know

29
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,480
I'll leave this boy to you.

30
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:04,480
I will teach Zhou Tie with all my heart

31
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,880
But Zhou Tie’s whole body’s orifices

32
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,280
Why is part of it blocked?
